      "title": "Croatia Packing",
      "content": "\n\n\n\n\n\nLuggages:-\n\n\n\n20kilos\n\n\n\n2x10kilo\n\n\n\n2 backpacks\n\n\n\nNate bag can be a ride on or bag - \n\n\n\n\n\n40 × 30 × 20 cm\n\n\n\n\n\nHailey bag \n\n\n\n\n\n5 kg (45 × 35 × 20 cm)\n\n\n\nplus doona and oyster\n\n\n\nHAILEY DAILY NEEDS\n\n\n\n\n\nLarge thermos\n\n\n\nSmall thermos\n\n\n\nGlass bottle\n\n\n\nThermos bag\n\n\n\nBlack thermal bag\n\n\n\n6x bottles\n\n\n\nWater bottle \n\n\n\nteaspoon\n\n\n\nElla’s pouches\n\n\n\nAny snacks 4m+ ?\n\n\n\n5x dummies\n\n\n\nDummy box\n\n\n\nDummy holder\n\n\n\nDummy soft toy\n\n\n\nMilk x 5 boxes\n\n\n\nNappies x 40\n\n\n\nWet wipes x4\n\n\n\nNappy cream\n\n\n\nSleep sack\n\n\n\nDeer to sleep with\n\n\n\nPJs (to determine & listed under clothes)\n\n\n\nRoom temp\n\n\n\nCamera\n\n\n\nMuslins x10\n\n\n\nSome detergent/pods\n\n\n\nSome white vinegar\n\n\n\nToys\n\n\n\nTeethers\n\n\n\nMeds - see separate list\n\n\n\nSanitizer (in each handy bag)\n\n\n\nNATHAN DAILY NEEDS\n\n\n\n\n\nCamera\n\n\n\n4/5 reading books\n\n\n\n2 friends to sleep with\n\n\n\nWater bottle\n\n\n\nCutlery\n\n\n\nPJs (listed under clothes)\n\n\n\n\n\n",
